---
config:
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 400
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: Who reaches the saved accounts
    accDescr: The saved accounts, with their tokens and remembered passwords, sit in chrome.storage.local, which only the extension's own contexts can read, the service worker and its pages: the popup, the options page and the switcher in its frame. content.js runs inside the Autodarts page and can't read the storage. It may ask the service worker only what its button shows, takes requests only from this extension and writes into the page's session only a token. The service worker takes a request to see or change the accounts only from a page of this extension. Its content security policy lets it connect to api.autodarts.com alone, and the browser blocks any other host.

    subgraph extension ["The extension's own contexts"]
        direction TB
        ui["The popup, the options page<br>and the switcher in its frame"]
        worker["The service worker<br>switches, renews, signs in"]
        storage[("chrome.storage.local<br>tokens and remembered<br>passwords")]
        ui -- "a request from a page<br>of the extension" --> worker
        worker <--> storage
    end
    subgraph page ["The Autodarts page, play.autodarts.com"]
        direction TB
        content["content.js<br>no access to the storage"]
        session["The page's session<br>in localStorage"]
        content <--> session
    end
    api["api.autodarts.com<br>the one host the<br>extension connects to"]
    other["Any other host<br>blocked by the content<br>security policy"]

    worker <-- "a token to read<br>or to write; content.js<br>may only ask what<br>its button shows" --> content
    worker -- "HTTPS" --> api
    worker -. "blocked" .-x other

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef person fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef failed fill:#dc26262e,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px
    class ui,content,session person
    class worker,storage bot
    class api done
    class other failed
